WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:10.512
This tutorial and the orange booking
are one class, not linked.

2
00:00:10.612 --> 00:00:15.513
Spoi suggests the match:
the booking pulses.

3
00:00:15.613 --> 00:00:19.515
Right-click the booking
to pair them.

4
00:00:19.615 --> 00:00:23.518
Afturkalla (undo)
takes it back.

5
00:00:23.618 --> 00:00:28.695
Saved: the session is green,
at its booked time.

6
00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:34.699
A session with no time: click it
under “Ekki tímasett”.

7
00:00:34.799 --> 00:00:40.702
Choose a Tímasetning (time) –
it moves onto the calendar.

8
00:00:40.802 --> 00:00:46.706
Pick a room. The yellow box shows
what that position collides with.

9
00:00:46.806 --> 00:00:51.710
“Engir árekstrar”: no clashes.
A good position.

10
00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.213
Staðfesta og vista
(confirm and save).

11
00:00:56.313 --> 00:01:01.216
A single click on empty space
does nothing.

12
00:01:01.316 --> 00:01:07.218
Double-click to create a session –
a two-slot lecture by default.

13
00:01:07.318 --> 00:01:12.220
Choose its weeks under
“Vikur sem á að bóka”.

14
00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:17.224
Saved – blue, because
it is not booked yet.

15
00:01:17.324 --> 00:01:21.225
To delete: “Eyða tíma”
(delete session).

16
00:01:21.325 --> 00:01:25.531
Saved – it is gone.

17
00:01:25.631 --> 00:01:31.535
A booked session can't be deleted
here – its booking would remain.
